import LieRings.FinitePlateau.Final

/-!
# Arbitrarily long finite plateaux in the dimension series

This is the public entry point for the explicit family used in Theorem A of
the accompanying manuscript.  For every `N ≥ 1`, the Lie ring
`FinitePlateau.L N` has `N + 1` consecutive equal dimension subrings and
then a strict drop.  The construction and its Hall--Magnus calculations are
split into the files under `LieRings/FinitePlateau/`; the publication-facing
statements are exported by `LieRings.FinitePlateau.Final`.
-/
